{"id":992,"date":"2022-12-20T11:05:23","date_gmt":"2022-12-20T11:05:23","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=992"},"modified":"2026-08-05T12:31:53","modified_gmt":"2026-08-05T12:31:53","slug":"machine-learning-business-role-applications","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/machine-learning-business-role-applications\/","title":{"rendered":"Role &amp; Applications of Machine Learning in Business Growth (2026)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p><em>Let&#8217;s know the importance, role, and applications of machine learning in business growth. <\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Machine Learning is one of the hottest technologies today, driving innovation for businesses of all sizes. In 2020, machine learning in business generated additional revenue of nearly <a aria-label=\" (opens in a new tab)\" href=\"https:\/\/www.forbes.com\/sites\/louiscolumbus\/2019\/03\/27\/roundup-of-machine-learning-forecasts-and-market-estimates-2019\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">$2.6 trillion<\/a> in marketing &amp; sales.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The advancements in machine learning and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">artificial intelligence (AI)<\/a> help businesses boost their efficiency, improve customer experience and relationships, generate more revenue, and automate mundane and routine tasks &amp; processes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>While many organizations have already adopted this technology, plenty are still wondering what the applications of machine learning in business are. How can machine learning drive business growth? How to strategically apply machine learning for business innovation?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>There are many more such questions running through the minds of business leaders, entrepreneurs, and decision-makers.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-default\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/lh5.googleusercontent.com\/trlrB_vZmCggXIaSs3N3W9HSWXaRasNBzfSgJxSVufUmXRxLX7NMff6lSs7OFZolrCX4GlWlwxsEc1If8XL41B_5pZ1SMLBPptNo6wQ-5WWxjnHybTep4KynjfH5P9hgVBPFAd4Y\" alt=\"role of machine learning in business\" style=\"width:455px;height:304px\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"> <em>Img Source: Freepik<\/em> <\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>In this article, we have answered most of these questions. Let\u2019s begin with a brief introduction to machine learning.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is Machine Learning?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Machine learning is a subset of AI that allows systems or machines to learn automatically from the data sets and experiences they can access. By analyzing the data sets and experiences, the technology then finds innovative and new outcomes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>ML doesn\u2019t really need extreme programming or algorithms\/rules to make decisions. What it does is learn the things themselves from large sets of data. The more data it has access to, the more it will learn and make decisions accordingly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Businesses of all sizes across all industries realize the benefits of machine learning techniques. These techniques are commonly used in chatbots, spam filters, digital assistants like Siri and Alexa, driverless cars, spam filters, etc.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Introduction of Machine Learning | Applications of Machine Learning | Learn Machine Learning\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/5NAh5yK8kl0?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\">\n<p><em>\u201cThe driverless car, for example, works on machine learning. A real driver drives, and there\u2019s a program that observes what the human does, and then you improve all the time.\u201d<\/em><\/p>\n<cite> \u2013<strong>Tamim Saleh, Senior Partner, McKinsey &amp; Company<\/strong> <\/cite><\/blockquote>\n\n\n\n<p>Machine learning tools and techniques are appropriate for categorizing a distinct type of data from large data sets. For instance, it can identify texts in images and videos and classify or divide similar data in the form of clusters.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>This technology also has the potential to make predictions, generate missing data, create and optimize content, improve <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/marketing-automation\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">marketing automation<\/a>, and do much more for businesses.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-default\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/lh3.googleusercontent.com\/SvVdQoOwEO6dkysd_JGuUBNcQxg3GoIp4syfzOcbV5ERElyDb6iUQfTTHJAQGJZDy_05sDzLPt1aPQTnt9-RnnmbGc4_EytF00zGuKCDN91KtPswCwRMp5EZAKHUdgxvBR2xvkRg\" alt=\"what is machine learning for business\"\/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"> <em>Img Source: Freepik<\/em> <\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>Recent research shows that 82% of marketers rely on machine learning and AI to make better personalization strategies. Furthermore, 64% of them trust these technologies to provide customers with well-curated and targeted content, offers, promos, etc.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>One of the top benefits of machine learning for business growth is in terms of strengthening marketing and sales with clear insights into data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wsc